                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit that had any damage points allocated to it by this unit&apos;s combat attacks this turn to be the target.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Subtract 1 from save rolls for the target for the rest of the battle. This unit can use this ability even if it has been destroyed.</characteristic>
