                    <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: Opponent declared a ^^**Spell**^^ ability for a unit within 30&quot; of this unit</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">• If this unit is not a **^^Wizard^^**, it can use the &apos;Unbind&apos; ability as if it had **^^Wizard (1)^^**. Otherwise, it can use the &apos;Unbind&apos; ability an additional time each phase.
• If this unit successfully unbinds the spell being reacted to and the caster is within the creeping overgrowth, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the caster equal to the difference between the casting roll and the unbinding roll, to a maximum of 6.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
