                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit used the &apos;Eruption of Fury&apos; ability this turn or you spent **rage dice** as part of the &apos;Fight Through the Pain&apos; ability when resolving the damage sequence for this unit this turn, give 1 ritual point to each visible friendly **^^Sylvaneth Priest^^** wholly within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic>
