                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">For each friendly **^^Sylvaneth^^** unit or friendly **Awakened Wyldwood** that was destroyed in the previous turn, you can pick a friendly **^^Sylvaneth^^** unit to be the target.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of each target&apos;s melee weapons for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
