                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">This unit can only use this ability if it is wholly within the **creeping overgrowth**. Pick this unit and up to 1 other friendly **^^Sylvaneth^^** unit. within this unit&apos;s combat range to be the targets.</characteristic>
