                  <attributes>
                    <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute>
                    <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute>
                    <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
                  </attributes>
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle, Reaction: You declared the &apos;Endless Growth&apos; ability</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit is wholly within the **creeping overgrowth**, for each target of that ability that is wholly within 12&quot; of this unit, you can pick 1 of the following effects:
• When resolving that ability, roll a D6 for the target instead of a D3. If, as a result of another ability, you would Heal **(3)** the target instead of rolling a dice, **Heal (6)** the target instead.
• If the target is **^^Kurnothi^^**, instead of rolling a D3 and picking 1 of the effects of that ability to apply to it, you can return 1 slain model to the target unit.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
                    <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
